{"title":"Briar Warden","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 46 Briar that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>40</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>40</td><td>in the wilds around 1481, 1453</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>35</td><td>in the wilds around 1510, 1458</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>5</td><td>in the wilds around 1354, 1292</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/briar-warden\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Maw's%20Sands\">Old Maw&#39;s Sands</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"briar-warden\" data-map-level=\"48\">Show level 48 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 12 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"briarwood\" title=\"Briarwood - in 83% of 12 looted corpses, 7 recorded drops, 11 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5a164111773bd319e75c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briarwood</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">83% · 10/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wild-rose-hip\" title=\"Wild Rose Hip - in 50% of 12 looted corpses, 6 recorded drops, 11 total, 1–3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/97ed0af0ce528f53d233.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wild Rose Hip</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">50% · 6/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-cutting\" title=\"Thorn Cutting - in 42% of 12 looted corpses, 4 recorded drops, 6 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/32fe2a6f1fb8885c9afb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Cutting</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">42% · 5/12</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"briarwood\" title=\"Briarwood - in 83% of 12 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 11 total, 2–5 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5a164111773bd319e75c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Briarwood</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">83% · 10/12</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"thorn-cutting\" title=\"Thorn Cutting - in 42% of 12 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/32fe2a6f1fb8885c9afb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Cutting</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">42% · 5/12</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 1501, 1453 <span class=\"muted\">· 51 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1487, 1387 <span class=\"muted\">· 38 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1395, 1335 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1399, 1435 <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1931, 1402 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1593, 1403 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 1583, 1446 <span class=\"muted\">· 2 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 2064, 1465 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"briar-warden\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Briar: <a href=\"#/monst